<title>USA: Tower Automotive in venture with Promotora.</title>
<headline>Tower Automotive in venture with Promotora.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tower Automotive said Tuesday it has agreed to form a partnership with Promotora de Empresas Zano SA de CV's Metalsa, a large vehicle frame and structures supplier in Mexico.</p>
<p>From an operational standpoint, the partnership arrangement is effective immediately, Tower Automotive said. Tower will ultimately obtain 40 percent interest in Metalsa, pending approvals on governmental and other matters.</p>
<p>Other terms of the combination were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Metalsa has headquarters in Monterrey, Mexico. Its manufacturing facilities are in Monterrey and San Luis Potosi, Mexico. Customers include Chrysler Corp and General Motors Corp, among others, Tower said.</p>
<p>-- ((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
